# Where the WebSocket server lives.
#
# Leave this unset and the client connects to `/ws` on its own origin — which
# is what you want for `npm run dev` (Vite proxies it) and for the single-service
# Docker deploy (the server serves the built client).
#
# Set it when the client is hosted separately, e.g. on Netlify or Vercel:
#
# VITE_SERVER_URL=wss://rerun-server.up.railway.app
